        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(qa-channel): add timeout to qa-bus state guarded fetch",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where `getQaBusState` called `fetchWithSsrFGuard` with no `timeoutMs` and no `AbortSignal`, so a loopback qa-bus peer that accepted TCP but never returned headers could hang Gateway/QA tooling forever (body idle caps never start).\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Pass `timeoutMs: QA_BUS_STATE_TIMEOUT_MS` (10s) through the existing guarded fetch, matching Feishu registration / similar Type C hang floors.\n- Optional `options.timeoutMs` overrides for hermetic hang regressions only; production callers omit it.\n- No new config/env surface.\n\n## User Impact\n\n**Before:** A hung qa-bus `/v1/state` peer could pin state inspection indefinitely.\n\n**After:** State fetches fail closed after 10s with `TimeoutError` so QA/monitor loops can continue.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHead: `cadb067c5abd997f396198b41094afd7e150eff2`\n\n### Executable negative control + fix proof\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/qa-channel/src/bus-client.test.ts -- --run -t \"negative control|never returns headers\" --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n```text\n[qa-channel bus-state negative control] outcome=still-pending wait_ms=200 without_timeoutMs=true\n[qa-channel bus-state hang proof] timed_out=true name=TimeoutError elapsed_ms=85 production_timeout_ms=10000\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  2 passed | 6 skipped (8)\n```\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\n- **Behavior addressed:** `/v1/state` guarded fetch hangs forever when peer accepts TCP but never returns headers.\n- **Canonical path:** `getQaBusState` → production `fetchWithSsrFGuard` with `timeoutMs: QA_BUS_STATE_TIMEOUT_MS` (10s) / test override.\n- **Boundary crossed:** local-runtime HTTP; real loopback `node:http` never-headers peer; production SSRF-guarded transport (negative control calls `fetchWithSsrFGuard` with **no** `timeoutMs`).\n- **After fix:** `TimeoutError` in ~80ms with override; production floor is the exported 10s constant.\n- **CI note:** `checks-node-compact-small-1` `readdirSync: 54` flake is unrelated tooling.\n\nAI-assisted.\n",
